                    {
                        "sense_id": "3d60708e-9f9e-351e-9af5-d987e3ccafa3",
                        "entry_id": "c581f047-5106-3407-a24e-0846001fa448",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Alternative spelling of jinn."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "alt-of",
                            "alternative"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "51e081a3-89ca-47c6-8669-163b76a5a031",
                                "sense_id": "3d60708e-9f9e-351e-9af5-d987e3ccafa3",
                                "text": "AZA'ZEL, one of the ginn or jinn, all of whom were made of \"smokeless fire,\" that is, the fire of the Simoom."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fe8e1f8d-fd7a-490d-b4d1-24865e07f0d7",
                                "sense_id": "3d60708e-9f9e-351e-9af5-d987e3ccafa3",
                                "text": "There also were the \"maids of modest glances,\" previously indifferent to the wooing \"of man or ginn.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e80e8c26-882f-4183-8054-0a649c951530",
                                "sense_id": "3d60708e-9f9e-351e-9af5-d987e3ccafa3",
                                "text": "I accordingly assumed Hassan to be a myth--a first cousin to the ginn."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "b7a8b92e-357e-3b35-83c2-76ca32696675",
                "word": "ginn",
                "pos": "verb",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "18fb216e-f775-3c0e-931e-fc35d7b4c77b",
                        "entry_id": "b7a8b92e-357e-3b35-83c2-76ca32696675",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Nonstandard form of given."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "alt-of",
                            "nonstandard"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "890bd46e-377c-4eef-a48f-a540375f0157",
                                "sense_id": "18fb216e-f775-3c0e-931e-fc35d7b4c77b",
                                "text": "You ginn it us hot--you did."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dc3409a1-00bf-4a97-aea7-56892c876fbb",
                                "sense_id": "18fb216e-f775-3c0e-931e-fc35d7b4c77b",
                                "text": "Well, the doctor axed me to vote for his son, and I just up and told him I would, only my relation was candidating also; but ginn him my hand and promise I would be neuter."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
